for a fixed a and W=t^c B_dR^+: each valueAt(a,mu,n_j)
belongs to K_a by valueAt_mem_valueField. If the original x
passes the test, the same finite sum with a_j replaced by
lambda(a_j) does too. More generally subtract a value v in K_a
as the extra coefficient -1; lambda(-1)=-1. This is the exact
valueAt_coordRetract_sub_mem_hodgeFil argument, including a
